  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8 - [88 ÷ 2 of 11 - (22 - 72 ÷ 4)]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5150c5b90ff0d3fbdd6a542cbd6ec09a59c26abaae848bd31e3bf0035c4d0714.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n8 - [88 ÷ 2 of 11 - (22 - 72 ÷ 4)]\n\n⇒ 8 - [88 ÷ 2 of 11 - (22 - 18)]\n\n⇒ 8 - [88 ÷ 2 of 11 - 4]\n\n⇒ 8 - [88 ÷ 22 - 4]\n\n⇒ 8 - [4 - 4]\n\n⇒ 8 - 0 = 8\n\n**∴ Required answer is 8.**",
